{"file_name": "screenshot_5_creature.png", "id": "1559818478978287", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/613094043_1559818482311620_1858277794794842808_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aY38w8xiifIQ7kNvwGIejxd&_nc_oc=AdpbGTUw52LWEOr1rZCzK6_LPllZk7ocgVg2Xcng5wj17FFOR7kHeECvI8kJvkYZ53g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUtzryVZjL5bAJad4jCKaiefXizRuYt85FrSqGJT58WUQ&oe=6B104F4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Clayground", "keywords": ["art", "sculpt", "3d", "clay"], "long_description": "Clayground is true volumetric clay sculpting on Meta Quest.\nPaint infinite clay with zero polygon anxiety, on an unbounded canvas that grows wherever you sculpt. Capture any part of your sculpt as a stamp. Sculpt in mixed-reality passthrough at your real desk. Export to Blender with one press.", "short_description": "Real clay. Your room. Sculpt without limits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emotionull.art/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emotionull", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://emotionull.art/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1345650630966511"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "888881050951536"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785211200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1461880752676831", "version": "0.2.366"}, "id": "1278478724173176", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1461880752676831"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "New: Send to web. Capture > clayvr.com > Send to web puts the sculpt you have open into your clayvr.com account, where you can open and edit it in the browser studio (Files > From your headset). Save it in the headset first. From the web: Capture > clayvr.com > From the web lists the sculpts in your account. Pick one and it opens as a new save with what you changed in the studio. Layers you did not touch come back at full headset detail, and none of your saves are written over. Four new achievements for coming back: Back Again (sculpt on 3 different days), Clay Habit (7 days), Ten Keepers (save 10 times) and Stamp Collector (make 10 stamps of your own). Better: the Progress page has a medal for every achievement, shows how many you have earned and how many days you have sculpted, and draws a bar under the ones that count up. Marathon now counts your time at the clay, not only the seconds the trigger is held. When you come back, the welcome card shows the nearest achievement to earn. Left-handed? On the welcome card, pull the trigger with whichever controller you point with. The first screen now tells you how to press Start. Layers is called Layers and shows how much room for clay is used. American spelling throughout. Fixed: a rare crash on Quest 3 and 3S. A brand-new player was told the app was restoring a sculpt with nothing to restore. An unfinished tour no longer comes back on every launch.", "created_date": 1795558703, "id": "1461880752676831", "version": "0.2.366", "version_code": 366, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1461880752676831"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "New\r\n\r\nConnect to clayvr.com: Capture > clayvr.com > Connect links your headset to your Clayground account with your Meta account. No code to type. If Meta can't confirm you yet, the headset shows a short code to enter at clayvr.com/workspace.\r\nOnce connected, Send latest GLB puts your newest export in your account in one press, privately, and your account's reference images show up in References.\r\n24 new stamps: a Mannequin, Torso, Arm and Leg to block out a figure; a four-legged body, Wing, Tail, Horn, Claw, Tentacle, Fin and Scales; Cone, Wedge, Tube, Bowl, Hex bar, Arch, Stairs and Spring; a Gear, Bolt, Chain link and Bone.\r\nA new look: rounded dark menus and solid highlights. Everything is where it was. Prefer the old one? Preferences > Look: Classic.\r\nCel shading: Preferences > Cel shading draws your sculpt like a cartoon.\r\nPhotos with a transparent background: Preferences > Photo: Cutout.\r\nChoose where the tool tip sits: Comfort > Tip (Handle, Between, Pointer or Pencil).\r\n\r\nBetter\r\n\r\nStamps work like Clay: press B twice to switch a stamp between Add and Erase. Big stamps now use far less of a layer's room.\r\nThe tool wheel shows a green plus or red minus for Add and Erase, and which way Swirl turns.\r\nThe brush has a dark edge, so you can see it on a light backdrop.\r\nStarter stamps have proper pictures, so a nose looks like a nose.\r\nMirror stays how you left it when you start a new sculpt.\r\nChanging tools by accident? Comfort > Wheel: Click only changes tool when you pull the trigger.\r\n\r\nFixed\r\n\r\nThe view could keep spinning after you let go of your sculpt. Spin is now off unless you turn it on at Comfort > Spin.\r\nThe welcome card and your clay could appear behind you when the app opened.\r\nPhotos no longer show up twice in your Quest gallery.", "created_date": 1795381188, "id": "1459767322888174", "version": "0.2.364", "version_code": 364, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1461880752676831"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "Found it. A feature called Spin was keeping the view turning if you let go while your hand was still moving. In today's update (0.2.360) it's off unless you turn it on. If you're still on the old build, switch it off now at Preferences > Comfort > Spin. Tell me if it still happens after the update.", "created_date": 1795289583, "id": "1458696012995305", "version": "0.2.360", "version_code": 360, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1461880752676831"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "Comfort > Tip now cycles Handle, Between, Pointer, Pencil. Pencil is the Pointer direction swung 40\u00b0 to the inside of the hand, so the tip sits about 6 cm to the left for a right hand and mirrors for Lefty.", "created_date": 1795213414, "id": "1457791856419054", "version": "0.2.359", "version_code": 359, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1461880752676831"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "A new look: rounded dark menus, solid highlights on what is selected, and every tool listed first on the Tools page. Everything is where it was. Prefer the old one? Preferences > Look: Classic, then reopen Clayground.\r\nFixed: when you opened Clayground, the welcome card and your clay could appear behind you or facing the wrong way. They now come to where you are looking.\r\nCel shading: Preferences > Cel shading draws your sculpt like a cartoon, in flat bands of light with a dark edge.\r\nChoose where the tool tip sits: Comfort > Tip. Handle (as before), Between, or Pointer, for holding the controller like a pen or a microphone.\r\nPhotos with a transparent background: Preferences > Photo: Cutout saves your sculpt as a PNG with nothing behind it. And photos no longer show up twice in your Quest gallery.\r\nChanging tools by accident? Try Comfort > Wheel: Click. The tool wheel then only changes tool when you point at one and pull the trigger. Also fixed a cut-off message on an empty Files page.", "created_date": 1795149138, "id": "1457001849831388", "version": "0.2.358", "version_code": 358, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}